You have a mailbox here, for mail between members. It never leaves
runv.club and nothing from outside gets in.

  echo "lunch?" | mail -s hi alice      send
  mail                                  read (or mutt, or alpine)

There are mailing lists for members. To join one, add its name to
~/.lists, one per line, and you're on it within a few minutes:

  echo general >> ~/.lists
  mail -s "hello all" list+general < note.txt

Lists: general, meta. Leave by taking the name out of ~/.lists.
Your mailbox holds up to 50MB. If you're suspended, mail to you bounces.
